The component writes to the residual stream strongly when the current token is a
short spelling of the sound "ug" / "uh" (Latin) or "уг" / "уж" / "ух" / "уш" (Cyrillic),
and most strongly on the Russian word "друг" (friend). It is switched slightly negative on
the Russian fragments "луч", "уч", "ча", "руч" (the "u + ch" sound, as in "улучшить").
