through the next few letters/subword pieces, is weaker inside a word, and is
usually small after long-vowel letters. Arabic articles and clitics are allowed
before the initial teh. Separately, a document-initial 'Title:' has a sharp
negative pulse on its colon. Outside these rules the prediction is zero.
This deliberately leaves smaller, less regular responses unexplained.
