from fragments. French -aient is excluded. Recent word frequencies give a
rough language estimate: Spanish contexts suppress the response. Short iar
and i | ar/ata/ada continuations give positive values. Romanization extends
these rules to accents and several other scripts, but not Han or Hangul.
